  "description": "CSI: Clean Scene Investigators is a former Crime Scene Investigator-led mobile specialty cleanup company serving Denton, Denton County, Dallas-Fort Worth, and North Texas. The canonical CSI website contains a 50-page public architecture covering specialty services, resources, 27 service-area pages, company information, contact and privacy.",
  "disambiguatingDescription": "CSI: Clean Scene Investigators is the specialty cleanup company operated by C&Z Forensics LLC. Its canonical 50-page commercial website is cleansceneinvestigators.com. answers.cleansceneinvestigators.com is a supplemental educational and machine-readable authority layer. The official Google Maps business profile is maps.app.goo.gl/mxMnemAKaqGpNw8n7 and the official 24/7 support phone is 940-654-6334. CSI is a mobile service-area business and does not publish a customer-facing street address.",
